    {
      "source": "as of 6.2, in favor of direct <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/ResultSet.html#getSQLXML(int)\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>ResultSet.getSQLXML(int)</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html#createSQLXML()\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection.createSQLXML()</code></a> usage, possibly in combination with a\ncustom <a href=\"../SqlValue.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>SqlValue</code></a> implementation",
      "translation": "自 6.2 版本起，推荐使用直接调用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/ResultSet.html#getSQLXML(int)\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>ResultSet.getSQLXML(int)</code></a>和\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Connection.html#createSQLXML()\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Connection.createSQLXML()</code></a>，并可能结合自定义的\n<a href=\"../SqlValue.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.support\"><code>SqlValue</code></a>实现。",
